mes, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <h1>Account settings</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy.</p>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Account active</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"profile\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Profile</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Update the personal details associated with your account.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" aria-label=\"Profile initials\">AM</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Alex Morgan</strong>\n        <span class=\"muted\">Profile photo</span>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Upload photo</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\">Remove</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"label\">First name</span>\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"Alex\" autocomplete=\"given-name\">\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Last name</span>\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"Morgan\" autocomplete=\"family-name\">\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Email address</span>\n        <input type=\"email\" value=\"alex.morgan@example.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Used for sign-in and account messages.</span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"label\">Time zone</span>\n        <select>\n          <option selected>Pacific Time (US &amp; Canada)</option>\n          <option>Mountain Time (US &amp; Canada)</option>\n          <option>Central Time (US &amp; Canada)</option>\n          <option>Eastern Time (US &amp; Canada)</option>\n          <option>UTC</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Last updated June 12, 2025</span>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\">Save profile</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"notifications\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Notifications</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what we send you and where you’d like to receive it.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Email notifications</h3>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Account activity</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Security alerts and important changes to your account.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Product updates</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">News about features and improvements.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\">\n        <span><strong>Tips and recommendations</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Occasional guidance tailored to your usage.</span></span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">In-app notifications</h3>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Activity reminders</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Reminders about tasks and activity that may need your attention.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Replies and mentions</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">When someone replies to you or mentions you.</span></span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Account security emails can’t be turned off.</span>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\">Save preferences</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"privacy\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Privacy</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Control how your profile and activity are shared.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Show my profile to teammates</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Teammates can see your name, profile photo, and email address.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\">\n        <span><strong>Include me in the member directory</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Let other members find your profile in the directory.</span></span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check row gap-sm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked>\n        <span><strong>Allow usage analytics</strong><br><span class=\"small muted\">Share anonymous usage data to help improve the service.</span></span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Download your data</strong>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Request a copy of the personal data associated with your account.</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" type=\"button\">Request data</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <strong>Delete account</strong>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">Permanently delete your account and associated data.</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\" type=\"button\">Delete account</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row between\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Changes apply to your account immediately.</span>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" type=\"button\">Save privacy settings</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>","deltas":[[6157,"<"],[6157,"main"],[6159," class"],[6163,"=\""],[6167,"page"],[6170," stack"],[6172," gap"],[6175,"-lg"],[6178,"\">\n"],[6182," "],[6184," <"],[6189,"header"],[6192," class"],[6196,"=\""],[6200,"stack"],[6203," gap"],[6206,"-sm"],[6210,"\">\n"],[6215,"   "],[6215," <"],[6221,"div"],[6225," class"],[6227,"=\""],[6230,"row"],[6233," between"],[6237,"\">\n"],[6241,"     "],[6243," <"],[6247,"div"],[6249," class"],[6252,"=\""],[6257,"stack"],[6264," gap"],[6270,"-sm"],[6271,"\">\n"],[6273,"       "],[6278," <"],[6281,"h"],[6285,"1"],[6288,">"],[6292,"Account"],[6295," settings"],[6300,"</"],[6304,"h"],[6307,"1"],[6311,">\n"],[6317,"       "],[6322," <"],[6325,"p"],[6331," class"],[6333,"=\""],[6335,"lead"],[6339,"\">"],[6341,"Manage"],[6345," your"],[6347," profile"],[6347,","],[6350," notification"],[6353," preferences"],[6357,","],[6362," and"],[6364," privacy"],[6367,".</"],[6369,"p"],[6370,">\n"],[6372,"     "],[6374," </"],[6379,"div"],[6380,">\n"],[